    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13570" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>matter of doubt, question, puzzle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
